    (∀ z : Matrix (Fin a') (Fin (a + a')) (GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.AE D.host.F D.host.E), GlobalTheory.IndefiniteRowSideFullHecke.WeilTensorModels.At (evFin D.host.F v) z →
